## The DRY line

This file is the standing statement of **when** to cut a release. The **how** (title format, heading vocabulary, `gh` mechanics) is the [`writing-release-notes`](../../.claude/skills/writing-release-notes/SKILL.md) skill; the **versioning rationale** (which line the repository is on, minor/patch, what the next major means, breaking-change classes) is the repository's own decisions record. It sits inside the branch → PR → merge flow in `AGENTS.md`.

It also states **what counts as breaking**: the **declared surface** that test reads is [`README.md`](../../README.md#public-surface). The test lives here, the surface is declared there, and neither restates the other. The release section of that README is the other half of the **how**.
